WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.636
Select the annotated layer inside the
Design frame.

00:00:05.036 --> 00:00:08.673
Check only the note you want to submit.

00:00:10.073 --> 00:00:13.573
Review and send the design.

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:19.973
Check the saved note and Figma source link
in Design discussion.

00:00:21.373 --> 00:00:25.464
Unselected notes are excluded. BA
confirmation is still required.
